浮在半空，环境光线因为能量爆发而产生扭曲的视觉效果，统一为极具冲击力的爆发性高光色调。", "Next Scene: 5，大远景，鸟瞰视角，画面中古尔丹将手中的邪能风暴猛力砸向地面的裂隙，一道巨大的绿色光柱冲天而起贯穿云层，整个山脊开始崩塌，无数恶魔的虚影在光柱周围若隐若现，大地龟裂出发出绿光的纹路向四周疯狂蔓延，环境仿佛世界末日降临，统一为史诗般宏大且毁灭性的末世灾难色调。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 417, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": "12", "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "p0", "links": [417], "label": "p0", "type": "*", "localized_name": "p0"}], "size": [270, 78], "pos": [1941.0565185546875, 2292.05419921875], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "pwd"}, "name": "pwd", "label": "pwd", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "pwd"}, {"name": "image1_1", "link": 418, "label": "image1_1", "type": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "text2_2", "link": 419, "label": "text2_2", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 151, "type": "RHHiddenNodes", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHHiddenNodes", "info": "", "ref_info": "Z0FBQUFBQnBJRzB1eDRPQU9SU1FudTJxRjZvUUdQQWZVU25vZVJXWnBGVkVvUVdzdHlhM25sRFZyczhCOTVNZEdXX0ZzQy14NnVxWjFPQ2R1bXZ5d0xRQ2p4NTdDNG1ieXc9PQ=="}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [307, 308, 309], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["pasted/cd3aecab67bbc3593b3cbe243f5cef9bb6a3672e04f5a9a7e6e164ff35cabdfd.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [617.4111938476562, 1020.5947265625], "pos": [-192.8644256591797, 2135.923828125], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable